[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14351.91, "timestamp": "03:59:11", "text": "不在推特上。我聯繫了對方。或許是在她洗澡的時候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14354.59, "timestamp": "03:59:14", "text": "我加入了她。是的，我和她一起去了。是的。是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14373.309, "timestamp": "03:59:33", "text": "。然後我問她，你想嗎？是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14387.269, "timestamp": "03:59:47", "text": "。  尼拉，這就是社區"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14389.429, "timestamp": "03:59:49", "text": "。你"}]